<title>UK: BOE offers conversion of 2013/17 stock into 2015.</title>
<headline>BOE offers conversion of 2013/17 stock into 2015.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said holders of 12 percent Exchequer stock due 2013-2017 would be offered the chance to convert their holding into 8.0 percent Treasury stock due 2015 at the rate of 136.55 stg nominal of the latter for 100 stg of the former.</p>
</text>
